    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "With the constantincrease of the mankind demanding the mineral products, easily mining resource is becoming more and more scarce, and it’s the inevitable trend of mining complex ore body. On the other hand, national environmental protection policy increasingly stringent. How to exploit and utilization mineral resourcesreasonably, efficiently, economically, safely and reduce loss of resource and dilution of ore is the question of mineral developers caring about. Due to the advantages of increasing recovery rate, reducing dilution rate, controlling underground pressure and mitigating of environmental disturbance, filling method is becoming more and more widely used.(Times New Roman小四号，两端对齐)\\r",
      "style": "正文"
    },
